<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA MAKE 227 IN ASIA CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA MAKE 227 IN ASIA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India scored 227 for six wickets in their 50 overs in an Asia Cup match against Sri Lanka on Friday.</p>
</text>
